# Responsive design

## Breakpoints

- compact ≤479px (phones, 1 column)
- mobile ≤768px (portrait, full width).
- tablet 769-1023px (2 columns)
- desktop ≥1024px (target layout, sidebar, grids).

## Rules

- Mobile-first: base styles mobile, extensions from `min-width`.
- For custom media queries use `--bp-*` variables, not arbitrary px.
- Tailwind: prefer `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`; align breakpoints in `@theme` with `--bp-*`.
- Public templates: plan compact→mobile→tablet→desktop. Test mobile and desktop.
- Admin panel: desktop only (`min-width: var(--bp-desktop-min)`). Horizontal scroll allowed, no full responsiveness.
- Mobile (public): touch targets ≥44px, no horizontal scroll of the whole page. Tables: `.table-responsive`.

## Avoid

- Rigid px without `max-width: 100%`. Separate breakpoints in JS — layout in CSS.
